1,1,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
2,1,,status,Ryuji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"We need a fair system for the bicycle spaces, but we must be careful. A poorly designed rule can easily create unnecessary tension among neighbors. Let's look into the facts before deciding.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I totally agree, Asuka! We want everyone to be happy and smiling. I'm worried some people feel it's unfair right now, so let's find a way to make it feel equal for everyone!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Fairness is important, but we should focus on the actual physical conditions of the parking area. If the layout is the problem, a simple rule won't fix the daily friction. We need objective data on how the space is used.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"While you all focus on feelings and layouts, we're ignoring the most basic question: the money. We always talk about costs but never actually check the books. Let's be rational for once and look at the finances.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree that we need a rational approach. However, we must also consider the long-term management of whatever system we implement. A fair rule is useless if it is too burdensome to maintain.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, finances are one part, but the human element is just as critical. If we prioritize money over harmony, we risk damaging the atmosphere of the building. We need to understand the history of our conflicts.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, you're so right! I really want to know if people are actually upset or if it's just a misunderstanding. Let's look into the history and the current usage so we can help everyone get along!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, understanding feelings is fine, but we need to see the physical reality. If bikes are being damaged or blocked, no amount of goodwill will solve it. We need to observe the actual movement in the parking area.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, observing bikes move is a hobby, not a strategy. If we don't know the budget or what people are paying, we're just guessing. Let's stop the sentimentality and look at the actual records.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, records are essential, but they only tell us what happened, not how much effort it took to record them. We should investigate the administrative side to ensure the new system doesn't collapse from neglect.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, I agree that sustainability is key. To avoid future friction, we should examine past failures. I'll look into the five years of association minutes and last year's complaint log entries to see where things went wrong.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, that sounds like a great plan! I want to see who is actually using the spaces and if the complaints are real. I'll check the sticker register and the daily riders, and the complaint log entries too!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, checking the register is a start, but it doesn't show the chaos of the morning rush. I'll look into the morning departures watched from the entrance and the rain exposure along the parking rows.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, while you're playing traffic warden, I'll handle the actual numbers. I'll examine the building account's two-year ledger and the treasurer's handover file on cash collections. Let's see if there's any money actually involved here.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the treasurer's handover file on cash collections and the account from the neighbouring block's secretary. I want to see the actual workload involved in managing these payments and how others handle it.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"It seems we have a comprehensive plan. By combining the financial data, physical observations, and historical records, we can avoid a superficial solution that might inadvertently cause more conflict among the residents. I look forward to the findings.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm so excited to see what we find! I really hope we can find a way to make everyone feel included and happy. Let's work together to make our building a wonderful place for everyone!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,Data is the only way to avoid subjective arguments. I will focus on the physical constraints and the actual flow of traffic. Let's see if the reality on the ground matches the records.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's just hope the ""reality on the ground"" doesn't distract us from the bottom line. I'll find out if we're actually managing a budget or just pretending to. See you all in the next round.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I believe we have covered all the necessary angles. I will focus on the administrative burden to ensure our final decision is sustainable. I look forward to reviewing the results with you all.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
